  "description": "2x DC motor driver with 78M05 positive voltage regulator (7..35 V) L298N: max 46 V, 2 A Set 5 V Enable jumper to enable 5 V regultor (needed for the L298N) and +5 V output at screw terminal or supply external +5 V at screw terminal Set ENA and/or ENB to +5 V to enable motor permanently or supply ENA and/or ENB with PWM signal IN1 and IN2 set rotation directory for motor A (OUT1/OUT2) IN2 and IN3 set rotation directory for motor A (OUT1/OUT2)",
